  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 6512.02 Denial of Interlock Service Provider Approval Hearing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6512.02 Denial of Interlock Service Provider Approval Hearing. Pursuant to Saf-C 6503.03, the scope of the hearing for an applicant for interlock service provider approval shall be limited to:\n\n(a) Review of the evidence submitted pursuant to Saf-C 6503.02 and Saf-C 6503.03; and\n\n(b) Whether the division correctly determined that the applicant failed to comply with RSA 265-A:36 and these rules.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 6500) #13448, eff 9-20-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c6500.html"
}
